DSH Research Studio
===================

An independent, community-built integration for DeepSeek Harness (DSH).
This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the
upstream projects listed below.

Upstream: PPT Master
--------------------
Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Hugo He
License: MIT
https://github.com/hugohe3/ppt-master

This repository contains an independent DSH panel and integration code.
It does not bundle the upstream Python source, templates, examples, or
SKILL.md. At runtime, the optional guide tool reads a user-provided local
checkout of the upstream project.

Upstream: Academic Research Skills
----------------------------------
