(stages, skill/mode taxonomy, integrity gates) and includes an original
summary of that workflow. It is distributed under CC BY-NC 4.0 and may not
be used for commercial purposes without separate permission from the
upstream rights holder. The root MIT license does not override this package's
license.

Host: DeepSeek Harness
----------------------
DeepSeek Harness (DSH) is the host application that loads these plugins.
This project uses DSH's public plugin APIs but is not an official DSH
project. DSH itself is governed by its own license.

